WEBVTT

00:00:19.260 --> 00:00:22.630
The world is in the Gourmet Age.

00:00:22.630 --> 00:00:24.070
Gourmet Hunters are explorers

00:00:24.070 --> 00:00:25.570
who travel the world,

00:00:25.570 --> 00:00:28.940
searching for your ingredients.

00:00:30.140 --> 00:00:33.210
And the ingredient at 
the top of this world

00:00:33.210 --> 00:00:35.280
is GOD, which is being sought

00:00:35.280 --> 00:00:37.980
by one Gourmet Hunter.

00:02:08.310 --> 00:02:11.440
Gourmet Corp. invaded the Cooking Fest!

00:02:11.440 --> 00:02:14.110
They tried to kidnap Komatsu 
and his fellow chefs!

00:02:16.710 --> 00:02:19.120
At last, the situation 
turned to all-out war!

00:02:21.390 --> 00:02:26.730
IGO led the best famous Gourmet 
Hunters and chefs against the threat.

00:02:28.290 --> 00:02:30.750
Coco of the Four Kings is 
facing off against Grinpatch.

00:02:31.530 --> 00:02:34.270
Sunny will have a 
showdown with Tommyrod.

00:02:35.430 --> 00:02:37.640
And Toriko is going to 
square off against Starjun!

00:02:37.640 --> 00:02:41.770
The curtain is about to rise 
on these fateful duels!

00:02:46.440 --> 00:02:50.770
Savage Battle! Toriko's 
Strongest Attack!

00:03:14.970 --> 00:03:18.140
I doubt that did much damage.

00:03:19.010 --> 00:03:21.550
Come out, Starjun!

00:03:30.190 --> 00:03:32.720
I beg to differ...

00:03:47.970 --> 00:03:50.510
That was a very impressive attack.

00:03:51.320 --> 00:03:55.320
The first time we met was 
during the Puffer Whale hunt.

00:03:56.250 --> 00:03:58.360
At a sandy beach in a grotto.

00:04:00.960 --> 00:04:03.660
I was passing through while 
operating a GT Robot.

00:04:05.050 --> 00:04:08.790
Just so you know, I'm not 
the same person I was then.

00:04:09.360 --> 00:04:13.100
I'm not gonna let you or your people 
make off with any more chefs.

00:04:14.630 --> 00:04:20.140
I'm gonna protect the 
chefs... especially Komatsu!

00:04:21.070 --> 00:04:23.470
Oh. Interesting.

00:04:24.810 --> 00:04:26.960
Then do your best to protect them.

00:04:27.310 --> 00:04:33.280
And also show me how 
strong you are... Toriko.

00:04:34.350 --> 00:04:36.420
Here I come, Starjun!

00:04:51.300 --> 00:04:52.870
What is this punch?!

00:05:14.260 --> 00:05:16.660
This delayed impact...

00:05:16.960 --> 00:05:19.730
That's right. Spiked Punch.

00:05:23.230 --> 00:05:26.940
Before, you couldn't release a Spiked 
Punch unless you'd saved up strength.

00:05:27.980 --> 00:05:33.610
But now, you let loose with it as 
if it's a regular punch, no sweat.

00:05:34.710 --> 00:05:39.050
I could throw punches like that all day.

00:05:42.920 --> 00:05:44.660
But that ain't all.

00:05:53.500 --> 00:05:54.770
I see.

00:05:55.410 --> 00:06:00.410
The power of each impact from the Spiked Punch has increased too.

00:06:00.640 --> 00:06:02.040
There you go.

00:06:02.960 --> 00:06:06.390
Certainly, you're obviously 
different from before.

00:06:07.350 --> 00:06:09.810
You've gained a lot of power.

00:06:10.780 --> 00:06:11.750
But...

00:06:12.450 --> 00:06:15.060
...that just means you're worth killing!

00:06:26.130 --> 00:06:30.070
Come out. I doubt that did much damage.

00:06:36.210 --> 00:06:38.140
I'd beg to differ.

00:07:04.070 --> 00:07:05.940
Fragrance Bazooka!

00:07:10.270 --> 00:07:12.630
No way am I letting you 
into the Fest stadium!

00:07:20.440 --> 00:07:21.810
A GT Robot!

00:07:33.900 --> 00:07:35.480
C-Chief Mansom?!

00:07:37.500 --> 00:07:40.030
I'll take care of them.

00:07:40.030 --> 00:07:42.400
You get away from here!

00:07:42.810 --> 00:07:46.020
It's okay! I came fully equipped.

00:07:46.020 --> 00:07:48.110
I can even take out a GT Robot...

00:07:48.110 --> 00:07:50.010
Don't you understand?

00:07:51.350 --> 00:07:55.520
GT Robots are the enemy, but it's 
not them you have to watch out for.

00:07:56.690 --> 00:07:58.990
It's me!

00:08:00.930 --> 00:08:03.190
I can't control myself...

00:08:03.660 --> 00:08:07.130
Even I don't know what I'm gonna do!

00:08:07.500 --> 00:08:08.570
Chief Mansom...

00:08:08.570 --> 00:08:11.060
It's dangerous to be near me!

00:08:11.540 --> 00:08:14.040
Get out of here now, while 
you have the chance!

00:08:14.040 --> 00:08:17.310
Got it! I'll go inside the stadium!

00:08:17.310 --> 00:08:19.640
I'll provide backup for 
the chefs and Toriko!

00:08:23.350 --> 00:08:26.550
Come on then, Gourmet Corp.!

00:08:35.360 --> 00:08:39.240
I don't believe this! It's all wrecked!

00:08:41.230 --> 00:08:42.700
The Fest...

00:08:42.700 --> 00:08:45.040
Haven't you evacuated yet?

00:08:45.570 --> 00:08:46.900
Brunch-san!

00:08:46.900 --> 00:08:50.410
I'm surprised a weakling like 
you is still in one piece.

00:08:50.410 --> 00:08:53.750
Thanks to Toriko-san and the 
others, I managed somehow...

00:08:55.010 --> 00:08:57.750
But Chef Zaus...

00:08:59.480 --> 00:09:02.820
Yeah, I didn't figure 
he'd get taken out.

00:09:02.820 --> 00:09:05.400
These Gourmet Corp. dudes 
are some tough customers.

00:09:12.790 --> 00:09:14.870
Here they come.

00:09:14.870 --> 00:09:16.700
A whole bunch of 'em.

00:09:17.500 --> 00:09:19.340
You better take shelter.

00:09:19.340 --> 00:09:22.440
You'll just get in the way here.

00:09:22.440 --> 00:09:23.570
But...

00:09:23.570 --> 00:09:27.950
Don't worry. Leave this to us!

00:09:27.950 --> 00:09:30.820
Livebearer-san! Everyone!

00:09:30.820 --> 00:09:33.050
We'll hurry up and hammer these

00:09:33.050 --> 00:09:35.250
bastards so we can get back to the Fest!

00:09:35.250 --> 00:09:38.260
Chef Komatsu, I lost our match,

00:09:38.260 --> 00:09:41.260
but I'll show you that my 
physical strength can't be beat!

00:09:41.530 --> 00:09:44.900
G-Got it, Chef Wabutora... Everyone...

00:09:50.130 --> 00:09:52.040
A fight! A fight!

00:09:53.900 --> 00:09:56.310
It's been so long, I'm 
just itching for this!

00:09:56.810 --> 00:09:59.540
Okay, here I come, Gourmet Corp.!

00:09:59.880 --> 00:10:00.810
Electricity?!

00:10:00.810 --> 00:10:05.720
Eat this! Synced Up Electric Punch!

00:10:10.900 --> 00:10:14.730
I'm gonna vaporize the whole lot of 
ya's, right down to the last cell!

00:10:15.240 --> 00:10:18.130
He wiped that many out 
in just one moment...

00:10:23.840 --> 00:10:26.270
I'm your opponent!

00:10:28.310 --> 00:10:31.280
I'll make delicious dishes out of you!

00:10:34.230 --> 00:10:36.750
Secret Technique: Oil Field Deep Fry...

00:10:39.830 --> 00:10:41.860
You'll be deep-fried to a golden brown.

00:10:42.410 --> 00:10:46.060
I actually wanted to use this 
technique during the Fest.

00:10:46.590 --> 00:10:50.600
I-I already knew it, but everyone...

00:10:51.360 --> 00:10:52.890
...i-is incredibly strong!

00:10:53.260 --> 00:10:54.670
Too strong!

00:10:56.030 --> 00:11:00.040
I-I was competing against 
these people at the Fest?!

00:11:04.480 --> 00:11:08.350
As expected, the high ranking chefs 
are more than holding their own!

00:11:09.850 --> 00:11:11.220
Here come some more!

00:11:11.550 --> 00:11:14.250
King Sleep Fragrance!

00:11:21.330 --> 00:11:22.730
This fragrance...

00:11:22.730 --> 00:11:27.170
...is made from the extracted 
cells of a King Sloth,

00:11:27.170 --> 00:11:30.740
which spends 364 days and 23 
hours of the year sleeping.

00:11:32.900 --> 00:11:34.670
One whiff...

00:11:34.670 --> 00:11:36.070
...and the target won't 
wake up for a month.

00:11:36.310 --> 00:11:38.910
And the sleepiness is infectious.

00:11:48.020 --> 00:11:50.220
The fragrance isn't working on them!

00:11:50.320 --> 00:12:00.730
Gourmet Corp Branch #6
"Garbage Can" Bei

00:11:51.190 --> 00:11:53.620
Not only that, they're totally creepy!

00:11:54.870 --> 00:11:57.550
You got somethin' good to eat?

00:11:57.550 --> 00:12:00.700
I'm so hungry, I can't sleep!

00:12:01.470 --> 00:12:05.700
I'll give you something 
even better than food!

00:12:07.870 --> 00:12:10.780
Take this... Fragrance Sword!

00:12:11.310 --> 00:12:16.150
Huh. Groovy! Come and 
get a piece, girlie!

00:12:16.440 --> 00:12:18.780
I'm finishing this fight here and now!

00:12:20.650 --> 00:12:27.690
Your dramatic improvement is 
more than I envisioned, Toriko.

00:12:28.630 --> 00:12:30.940
I went on a rough journey,

00:12:30.940 --> 00:12:34.370
did a lot of training, and got even stronger.

00:12:35.130 --> 00:12:39.400
But more than anything, I ate 
my fill of delicious food.

00:12:40.040 --> 00:12:44.380
Then your Gourmet Cells have 
been substantially activated?

00:12:44.680 --> 00:12:46.110
I'll tell ya one thing,

00:12:46.410 --> 00:12:49.350
what I've shown you so far is 
just the tip of the iceberg.

00:12:50.360 --> 00:12:53.720
But now I'll give you a taste 
of how much I've improved.

00:13:04.600 --> 00:13:05.860
I'll tell ya one thing,

00:13:06.630 --> 00:13:09.870
what I've shown you so far is 
just the tip of the iceberg.

00:13:10.980 --> 00:13:13.810
But now I'll give you a taste 
of how much I've improved.

00:13:14.570 --> 00:13:17.880
50-fold Spiked Punch!

00:13:38.200 --> 00:13:41.230
50-fold Spiked Punch!

00:13:55.310 --> 00:13:57.750
50 plus 50!

00:13:57.750 --> 00:14:02.020
100-fold Twin Spiked Punch!

00:14:17.240 --> 00:14:19.170
Leg Boomerang!

00:14:23.840 --> 00:14:25.940
Cannon Fork!

00:14:46.730 --> 00:14:50.440
50-fold Nail Gun!

00:15:59.350 --> 00:16:02.540
My Shiba Helmet cracked...

00:16:11.290 --> 00:16:13.770
I love how destructive that thing is!

00:16:13.770 --> 00:16:15.720
It's giving me chills!

00:16:15.920 --> 00:16:17.760
It's not only destructive!

00:16:18.390 --> 00:16:21.260
This sword was made from 
extracted King Sloth,

00:16:21.260 --> 00:16:24.960
and the slightest touch makes 
any creature fall asleep!

00:16:25.260 --> 00:16:32.200
But there's no way you can 
hit Bei-sama with it, girlie!

00:16:32.350 --> 00:16:33.600
In your dreams!

00:16:33.600 --> 00:16:35.560
And that's where you're going, dreamland!

00:16:35.560 --> 00:16:38.110
Bring it, girlie!

00:16:39.980 --> 00:16:41.110
Come on!

00:17:03.000 --> 00:17:07.540
Well, Gourmet Corp., you'd 
better stop me soon!

00:17:07.810 --> 00:17:11.640
Before the Knocking 
has totally worn off!

00:17:18.020 --> 00:17:26.760
Otherwise, even I won't 
be able to stop myself!

00:17:55.390 --> 00:17:57.460
Oh, my! Another swarm has come!

00:18:04.700 --> 00:18:07.030
Do you know what you've done?

00:18:07.030 --> 00:18:09.730
You've made my whole 
body become flooded with

00:18:09.730 --> 00:18:11.500
the neurotransmitter adrenaline,

00:18:11.500 --> 00:18:14.770
which makes a guy excited!

00:18:17.680 --> 00:18:20.350
Here they come!

00:18:22.250 --> 00:18:25.980
Underground Cooking's Doping Cooking!

00:18:25.980 --> 00:18:28.260
Prepare! Prepare! Prepare! Prepare!

00:18:29.250 --> 00:18:31.940
I'll prepare you all to be eaten!

00:18:39.730 --> 00:18:44.640
Stubborn bastards! I'll 
vaporize all of ya's!

00:18:45.000 --> 00:18:47.010
Mind-boggling strength,

00:18:47.440 --> 00:18:52.210
but no matter how many he kills, 
new ones keep on coming!

00:18:52.210 --> 00:18:53.630
There's no end!

00:19:03.450 --> 00:19:05.280
This makes me happy, Toriko.

00:19:06.020 --> 00:19:07.460
My blood is seething.

00:19:08.290 --> 00:19:11.760
Battling you gives me a thrill.

00:19:13.200 --> 00:19:16.130
So, shall we continue?

00:19:16.300 --> 00:19:21.430
Sure. I'll fight to your 
heart's content, Starjun!

00:19:22.240 --> 00:19:26.480
A blood-tingling savage fight...

00:21:17.860 --> 00:21:22.630
Guess the Legend! The 
Legend Gourmet Quiz!

00:21:18.560 --> 00:21:22.160
Guess the Legend! The 
Legend Gourmet Quiz!

00:21:23.090 --> 00:21:24.730
I'm your host, Tina.

00:21:24.730 --> 00:21:26.640
Now, in this segment,

00:21:26.640 --> 00:21:32.720
you guess the legendary ingredients of the Gourmet Age!

00:21:37.580 --> 00:21:43.680
Really?! Level 6

00:21:38.210 --> 00:21:41.080
Today's "Really?!" level is 6!

00:21:41.080 --> 00:21:43.920
Someone once said...

00:21:43.920 --> 00:21:47.090
Heavenly voice! Please 
help me today too!

00:21:47.090 --> 00:21:50.590
Okay, okay. Here we go.

00:21:51.790 --> 00:21:54.430
Someone once said...

00:21:54.430 --> 00:21:59.160
There is something-something, 
which is delicious hakusai cabbage

00:21:59.160 --> 00:22:02.200
that's bursting with 
juiciness and sweetness.

00:22:02.200 --> 00:22:05.200
The allotted time limit is 10 seconds.

00:22:05.200 --> 00:22:06.600
Start!

00:22:08.670 --> 00:22:10.580
Bursting with sweetness?

00:22:10.580 --> 00:22:15.150
Yes. Its refreshing taste feels 
great going down your throat.

00:22:15.150 --> 00:22:17.020
Refreshing? Feels great?

00:22:19.420 --> 00:22:21.680
There's delicious hakusai

00:22:21.680 --> 00:22:26.290
cabbage bursting with juiciness and sweetness...

00:22:26.290 --> 00:22:29.860
Hakucider Cabbage!

00:22:31.830 --> 00:22:34.870
Hakusai cabbage that tastes like cider?!

00:22:34.870 --> 00:22:37.440
That sounds like big trouble if 
you put it in a nabe stewpot!

00:22:37.440 --> 00:22:41.040
Indeed. I recommend eating it raw.

00:22:41.540 --> 00:22:43.940
And now let's get back on 
track with our next segment!
